		QBCHNI (Q-bus ChaosNet Interface)  ECO's 


For Revision 3 QBCHNI (earlier revision boards should no longer exist)

Fix QB:SYNC inversion

Drawing:  QQBXCV

		Unwire			Wire
		------			----
	   F07-11 : F08-11
	   F07-11 : F06-12	   F06-12 : F11-16
	   			   F07-11 : F11-15
				   F07-11 : F08-11	;restore

Fix board selection to depend on QB.BS7 rather than UBADDR16 and UBADDR17
n
Drawing:  QQBXCV, QADADR

	   F07-3  : B13-13			;remove UBI0
	   F06-7  : AC1				;flush QB.DAL.16 & 17
	   F06-5  : AD1		   F06-7  : AP2	        ;QB.BS7* L
	   F06-8  : F09-3	   F06-8  : F07-3	;QB.BS7 to latch
	   F06-6  : F09-4
	   F09-2  : E16-16
	   F09-5  : E16-18	   E16-17 : E16-18
				   E16-16 : F07-2

Fix init problem  (reset interrupt logic with RESET rather than INIT)

Drawing:  QQBINT

	   B10-14 : E10-16
	   E10-16 : F13-6	   B10-14 : E10-16	;restore
				   F13-6  : B20-3	;RESET L

NOTE: The interrupts for the Q-bus use the DEC DC003 Interrupt Protocol chip
which unfortunately is an edge-triggered interrupt protocol, whereas the unibus
version is level triggered.  This means, the software must clear interrupt
enable and reset them (if desired) before returning.

